# T0=L0/u0. run.dict dt/finalTime/writeDt remain CODE times.
Units
{
    mode SI
    L0 1e-6 m
    T0 1.6563100047570824e-7 s
    Phi0 50 V
    # Canonical Poisson charge scale epsilon0*Phi0/L0^2, matching Normalization.
